# Real secret values - never commit.
# .env holds this machine's actual credentials; CREDENTIALS.md is the local
# listing of them. .env.example (placeholders only) and SECRETS GEN GUIDE.md
# (the generation commands, no values) ARE committed - they are what lets a
# fresh clone run `make env` and get a working stack.
.env
CREDENTIALS.md

# Rendered/bootstrapped files containing real secrets
infra/keycloak/realm-custodian.json
.infisical-bootstrap.json

